      "subject": "לבקר — ka ɲinini",
      "rationale": "Sɛbɛnniw bɛ a rende 'ka ɲini' walima 'ka Yawe ɲini' — o bɛ fɔ Ahaz bɛ kɔkɔrɔ sarakabɔlan ba ka divination kɛ — kumasen ka gɛlɛn kosɛbɛ"
