      "rationale": "Heburukan לבקר ma yɔrɔ daɲɛ sɔrɔ — Bamanankan de ye a fara a kan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "Uriya",
      "rationale": "Masakɛ Ahaz kuma bɛ lasigida sarakalasebaga Uriya ma, kuma bilenbilen ye"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Masakɛ Ahaz y'a lasigida sarakalasebaga Uriya (Oriya) ma ko: sarakabɔlanba kan, ka sɔgɔma ka tasuma-saraka, wula ka kisɛ-saraka, masakɛ ka tasuma-saraka ni a kisɛ-saraka, dugukolo jamabɛɛ ka tasuma-saraka, u kisɛ-sarakaw ni u ji-sarakaw tɛmɛ; tasuma-sarakaw ka joli bɛɛ ni saraka ka joli bɛɛ, i kana min o kan; kɔkɔrɔ sarakabɔlan na kɛ n'ka ɲinini yɔrɔ ye.",
